"Component: Blood Sacrifice": {
  "index": "2",
  "category": "sorcery",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Blood Sacrifice"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "A potent yet dark spell that "
        },
        {
          "text": "binds the caster's vitality to the wellbeing of others",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nAs the incantation is spoken, a crimson aura envelops the caster, "
        },
        {
          "text": "siphoning a portion of their health",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " to release a wave of rejuvenating energy that "
        },
        {
          "text": "heals all affected targets",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nIf the caster is willing to "
        },
        {
          "text": "sacrifice a more significant portion of their own life force",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", this restorative magic "
        },
        {
          "text": "not only mends wounds but also dispels any lingering harmful effects",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " afflicting allies. \n\nShould the caster "
        },
        {
          "text": "relinquish an even greater measure of their own vitality",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the spell achieves its most miraculous feat: "
        },
        {
          "text": "transforming the tormented forms of zombie villagers back into their human selves",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", restoring life and hope to those once lost. \n\nThe caster, though weakened, becomes a beacon of selflessness, embodying the ultimate act of sacrifice for the greater good.\n\nOnly the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demons of the Nether",
          "color": "dark_red"
        },
        {
          "text": " could dream up something so gruesome yet beneficial."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "spell_part",
      "location": "mna:components/blood_sacrifice"
    }
  ]
}